%% README communication diagram: maintained together with authenticated-connection.svg/png.
%% Question: how does a caller authenticate to one selected node and receive task results?
%% Target: each execution node owns its authentication and HTTPS entry dependencies.
%% This diagram does not claim the deployed nodes have passed isolation acceptance.
%% Token acquisition/refresh is not repeated for every MCP request.
flowchart TB
    U["你：通过浏览器使用 ChatGPT<br/>选择目标节点的连接"]
    C["ChatGPT 中的 MCP 客户端<br/>接收授权回调、取得并管理令牌<br/>需要时刷新，不是每次请求都登录"]
    I["所选节点的 OAuth / OIDC 身份服务<br/>外部独立软件组件；独立于 Hand 代码<br/>登录、授权、签发 / 刷新令牌<br/>提供 metadata / JWKS；不执行任务<br/>逐机部署目标，不依赖另一执行机"]
    G["目标节点的 HTTPS 入口<br/>反向代理 / 可选 Tailscale 入口"]
    S["Local Hand MCP Server<br/>核对 issuer、audience、签名和有效期<br/>按预配 issuer 读取 metadata / JWKS"]
    B["本地作业后端<br/>按 scope 与原任务归属授权<br/>受控准备、提交、查询、取消"]
    T["本地任务进程<br/>启动、停止与结果收集<br/>查询不重新执行任务"]
    R["你取回并核对结果，继续各自任务<br/>原节点 + 原任务：状态与可用证据<br/>结果未知时沿原任务 ID 查询，不自动重提"]

    U -->|"选择连接与操作"| C
    U -->|"① 浏览器登录、授权"| I
    I -->|"② 授权码回调（经浏览器）"| C
    C -->|"③ 授权码 + PKCE 换令牌"| I
    I -->|"access token 响应"| C
    C -->|"④ access token + MCP 请求（HTTPS）"| G
    G -->|"转发请求与结果"| S
    S -.->|"预配 issuer：读取 metadata / JWKS；响应沿原连接返回"| I
    S -->|"⑤ 身份校验后送作业后端授权"| B
    B <-->|"启动 / 停止 / 收集"| T
    B -->|"⑥ 原状态与证据，经原入口返回客户端"| R

    %% Local CLI / Unix socket uses OS identity and local permissions independently.
    %% The identity service never accepts a task execution instruction.
    %% Authentication metadata URLs are deployment inputs, not caller-supplied URLs.
    %% HTTPS entry and issuer dependencies must be checked independently from local recovery.
